From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:31:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD vim visual selection for terminal panes so users can
 copy focused text

Terminal command mode tracks a pane-local visual selection over rendered cells, allowing character, line, and block yanks from either pane while preserving normal navigation and typing notices.
